<div id="file-input-overview">
    <h1>File Input Component</h1>
    
    <p>
        The file-input lets the user choose one or more files from their device storage. Once chosen, the files can be uploaded to a server using${" "}
        <a
            target="_blank"
            href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/Forms"
        >
            form submission
        </a>
         , or manipulated using JavaScript code and
        <a
            target="_blank"
            href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/File_API/Using_files_from_web_applications"
        >
            the File API
        </a>
         .
    </p>
    <p>
        The entire element can function as a dropzone for drag and drop, however this functionality requires JavaScript and is outside the scope of a CSS library such as eBay Skin.
    </p>
</div>
